|~ A host's labels, written as the prototype proposes: a label is its
   page, an aspect is a quote under it that runs on the value it is
   named on, `::holds` is a law every value under the label keeps, and an
   action is a verb under it. ~|

:Stage
  |~~ A stage of a run. ::holds~(seconds | gte 0) ~~|

:Stage/name |~~ The name of the stage. ~~| ~(/0)
:Stage/outcome
  |~~ :ok passed, :flaky passed after a retry, :fail failed, :skip did
      not run. ~~|
  ~(/1)
:Stage/seconds |~~ The seconds it took. ~~| ~(/2)

:Fail
  |~~ A test that failed at least once. ~~|

:Fail/name |~~ The name of the test. ~~| ~(/0)
:Fail/attempts |~~ The attempts it took; the last one passed unless the verdict is :red. ~~| ~(/1)

:Pipe
  |~~ One run of the CI pipeline. ~~|

:Pipe/id |~~ The number of the run. ~~| ~(/id)
:Pipe/verdict
  |~~ The verdict: :green, every stage passed at its first attempt;
      :amber, every stage passed, some after a retry; :red, some stage
      failed. ~~|
  ~(/st)
:Pipe/stages |~~ The stages in the order they ran. ~~| ~(/stages * tag ::Stage)
:Pipe/owners |~~ Who is paged when the verdict is :red. ~~| ~(/owners)
:Pipe/fails |~~ The tests that failed at least once. ~~| ~(/fails * tag ::Fail)
:Pipe/ok |~~ Whether the run counts as passed, true for :green and :amber. ~~| ~(verdict | ne :red)
:Pipe/slowest |~~ The name of the stage that took longest. ~~| ~(stages | max ~(seconds) | name)
:Pipe/flaky |~~ The names of the tests that passed only after a retry. ~~| ~(fails * name)
:Pipe/@retry
  |~~ Runs one stage again and answers the new ::Pipe.
      ::call~(@retry :test) ~~|
  ::verb~(:stage ::keyword | ::builtin{})

:Box
  |~~ A parcel as the courier measures it. ::holds~(length | gt 0) ~~|

:Box/length |~~ The length, in centimetres. ~~| ~(/0)
:Box/width |~~ The width, in centimetres. ~~| ~(/1)
:Box/height |~~ The height, in centimetres. ~~| ~(/2)
:Box/weight |~~ The weight of what is inside, in kilograms. ~~| ~(/3)
:Box/volume |~~ The space inside, in cubic centimetres. ~~| ~(mul length (mul width height))
:Box/density |~~ Kilograms per cubic centimetre. ~~| ~(div weight volume)
:Box/empty
  |~~ The same box with nothing inside.
      ::call~(empty) ~~|
  ~(within ~(take 3 | append 0))
:Box/put
  |~~ The same box with another weight inside.
      ::call~(put 10) ~~|
  ~(within ~(take 3 | append weight))
:Box/put/weight
  |~~ The weight to put inside, in kilograms. ::holds~(type | eq ::number) ~~|
  ~(/0)

:error/actualType |~~ The kind of the value the place refused. ~~| ~(/actualType)

:run
  |~~ The last run of the pipeline the tool answered. ~~|
  ::Pipe{:id 8812 :st :red
    :stages [[:checkout :ok 3.1] [:build :ok 41.2] [:unit :flaky 88.5] [:integration :fail 240.7] [:lint :skip 0] [:package :skip 0] [:deploy :skip 0]]
    :owners #[:ann :bob]
    :fails [["parse/empty" 2] ["eval/deep" 3] ["db/pool" 4] ["db/timeout" 4]]}

:Box/pack
  |~~ The same box packed again: another weight inside, and a note on it.
      ::call~(pack {:weight 9 :note "fragile"}) ~~|
  ~(within ~(take 3 | append weight))
:Box/pack/weight
  |~~ The weight to put inside, in kilograms. ::holds~(type | eq ::number) ~~|
  ~(/0/weight)
:Box/pack/note
  |~~ A note for the courier, none when left out. ~~|
  ~(/0 | at :note | coalesce "")
